{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43513","headline":"霜隼下晴臯 · 无名氏","name":"霜隼下晴臯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九臯霜气劲，翔隼下初晴。\n风动闲云卷，星驰白草平。\n棱棱方厉疾，肃肃自纵横。\n掠地秋毫迥，投身逸翮轻。\n高墉全失影，逐雀作飞声。\n薄暮寒郊外，悠悠万里情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43513.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43513","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}